          "guid": "mtp1azrwiz1ugq8d",
          "message": {
            "text": "The scroll document must be both generation-transactional and namespaced. The snapshot preserves glyph and embedded-font mappings accumulated by earlier and later outer frames, while the namespace isolates the nested document itself; either half alone leaves one collision path open. Chromium 7d859f271c confirms local SVG IRI lookup uses the shared TreeScope in thirdparty/blink/renderer/core/svg/svguri_reference.cc:122-158. See also the single-def emission in src/scroll/composer.ts and the rendered boundary proof in tests/compose-animate-frames.e2e.test.ts.",
            "markdown": "The scroll document must be both generation-transactional and namespaced. The snapshot preserves glyph and embedded-font mappings accumulated by earlier and later outer frames, while the namespace isolates the nested document itself; either half alone leaves one collision path open. Chromium 7d859f271c confirms local SVG IRI lookup uses the shared TreeScope in third_party/blink/renderer/core/svg/svg_uri_reference.cc:122-158. See also the single-def emission in src/scroll/composer.ts and the rendered boundary proof in tests/compose-animate-frames.e2e.test.ts."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/cli/animate-orchestrator.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1669,
                  "endLine": 1682,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    // The scroll composer owns a complete nested document and starts its own\n    // generation, so isolate that reset from the outer animation's accumulated\n    // glyph/font registries. Otherwise a scroll frame after an ordinary capture\n    // rewinds gN/dmfN and replaces the earlier frame's addressing. Namespace the\n    // finished document too: Blink resolves local SVG IRIs through the shared\n    // TreeScope, so a nested <svg> is not an id boundary.\n    const outerGeneration = snapshotGeneration();\n    let composed: string;\n    try {\n      composed = composeScrollSvg(segments, { viewportW: scrollClip[2], viewportH: scrollClip[3] });\n    } finally {\n      restoreGeneration(outerGeneration);\n    }\n    composed = namespaceEmbeddedAnimatedSvg(composed, `sf${i}_`);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
