          "message": {
            "text": "Use the executor's final segment end as the embedded period because composeScrollSvg derives the nested CSS loop from the same boundary. This keeps metadata and rendered timing identical while letting generateAnimatedSvg perform the established master-timeline re-anchoring.",
            "markdown": "Use the executor's final segment end as the embedded period because composeScrollSvg derives the nested CSS loop from the same boundary. This keeps metadata and rendered timing identical while letting generateAnimatedSvg perform the established master-timeline re-anchoring."
          },
